  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "KYOGRE has the power to create massive rain clouds that cover the entire sky and bring about torrential downpours. This POKéMON saved people who were suffering from droughts.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "KYOGRE is named in mythology as the POKéMON that expanded the sea by covering the land with torrential rains and towering tidal waves. It took to sleep after a cataclysmic battle with GROUDON.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "KYOGRE has appeared in mythology as the creator of the sea. After long years of feuding with GROUDON, it took to sleep at the bottom of the sea.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "This POKéMON is said to have expanded the sea by bringing heavy rains. It has the power to control water.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "This POKéMON is said to have expanded the sea by bringing heavy rains. It has the power to control water.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
